5. Operator Notes
Docker remains deployment/install truth
Host-Go is currently the fast dev loop
Postgres should stay internal/local-only
Backend currently uses port 8081
Session slug is hardwired to the-cave in current endpoints
Elements belong to library layer; venue stores placement, not ownership
Observation path was intentionally built before reaction and speech
6. Blockers & Workarounds

BLOCKER: Docker rebuild loop was slow for active coding
CAUSE: Full image rebuild on each backend change
WORKAROUND: Installed Go on host and ran backend directly against Docker Postgres
OPERATOR ACTION REQUIRED: Use host-Go for active dev, Docker backend for install validation

BLOCKER: Host-Go backend could not reach Postgres initially
CAUSE: Docker hostname works in container network, not from host process
WORKAROUND: Bound Postgres to localhost and used localhost DATABASE_URL
OPERATOR ACTION REQUIRED: Run host backend with localhost DB URL during dev mode

7. Deviations from Kernel
No browser UI proof yet; proof was done through API/WebSocket terminals
Actor role currently comes from join payload rather than a fuller permissions flow
Speech currently renders as action payload only; no dedicated front-end presentation layer yet
8. Known Issues
Snapshot action order is descending in history replay
No note-card flow yet
No reveal/hide flow yet
No dedicated actor/director tooling yet
No polished browser-facing stage UI yet
